archy\"/> <a href=\"StructureDefinition-EHDSECGResearchRecord-definitions.html#EHDSECGResearchRecord\" title=\"Research extraction profile for EHDS secondary use (chapter IV of the Regulation): one record per pseudonymised subject. Shares the semantic core of the care profile, does not require a PDF rendering, and documents what a training or evaluation set needs.\">EHDSECGResearchRecord</a><a name=\"EHDSECGResearchRecord\"> </a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/conformance-rules.html#constraints\" title=\"This element has or is affected by constraints ( ecg-rep-1, ecg-rep-2, ecg-res-1 )\" class=\"xhtConstraintStyle\">C</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">0</span><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">..</span><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">*</span></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"http://build.fhir.org/types.html#Base\">Base</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">ECG research record model<br/><span class=\"xhtPieceBold\">Instances of this type can be the target of a Reference</span><br class=\"constraint\"/><span class=\"constraint\">Constraints: </span><span title=\"TODO: placeholder for invariant ecg-rep-1, to be defined.\" class=\"xhtPieceBold constraint\">ecg-rep-1</span><span class=\"constraint\">, </span><span title=\"TODO: placeholder for invariant ecg-rep-2, to be defined.\" class=\"xhtPieceBold constraint\">ecg-rep-2</span><span class=\"constraint\">, </span><span title=\"TODO: placeholder for invariant ecg-res-1, to be defined.\" class=\"xhtPieceBold constraint\">ecg-res-1</span></td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowOdd\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck10.png)\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\