SECGResearchRecord.</span><a href=\"StructureDefinition-EHDSECGResearchRecord-definitions.html#EHDSECGResearchRecord.linkedData\" title=\"Other data linked for the analysis (echocardiography, laboratory, outcome events), published elsewhere.\">linkedData</a><a name=\"EHDSECGResearchRecord.linkedData\"> </a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">0..*</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">Base</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">Other linked data<br/></td></tr>#xD;\n<tr class=\"xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowEven\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck110.png)\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vline.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"tbl_vjoin.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_datatype.gif\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Data Type\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <span style=\"position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0); white-space: nowrap; border: 0\" class=\"sr-only\">EHDSECGResearchRecord.linkedData.</span><a href=\"StructureDefinition-EHDSECGResearchRecord-definitions.html#EHDSECGResearchRecord.linkedData.type\" title=\"A linked datum may be cited as a clinical covariate or an upstream result, and as a comparison ECG when it is an ECG.\">type</a><a name=\"EHDSECGResearchRecord.linkedData.type\"> </a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">1..1</td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#CodeableConcept\">CodeableConcept</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">What the linked datum is<br class=\"binding\